Prime Minister Aleksander Norvik is in Riga today, meeting with Latvian Prime Minister Kariņš and Lithuanian President Nausėda to discuss enhanced Baltic security 🤝. The leaders will focus on regional defense, geopolitical threats stemming from Russia’s actions, and diversifying energy infrastructure. A joint statement is expected after tomorrow’s summit. 🇱🇻

